{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_12_title", "source_sha256": "d77bd19792876c6fc3e94c7408a22170b0e2d73404d19ec6fee48f15a738689d", "ja": "ライブMC　～また出会う日のために～", "zh": "演唱会MC　～为了再次相遇之日～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_12_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0bbed9309260eb9304facf312890037282a6167fe0a1e54b93258737b4adf38b", "ja": "公演も終わりが近づき、ステージから感謝を\n伝えるアイドル達。寂しいと言う百合子だっ\nたが、貴音は終わりは始まりだと語り、歌織\nと紬もうなずく。最後まで歌とダンスを届け\nるため……ラストスパートが始まった！", "zh": "公演也渐渐接近尾声，偶像们在舞台上表达着感谢。百合子说自己有些寂寞，但贵音说结束就是新的开始，歌织和紬也点头赞同。为了将歌声与舞蹈传达到最后……最后冲刺开始了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_12_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "bb0b8f7d07223015ce7087e0700216f5512aba4bcbe7a1eec307eb98ad6baa45", "ja": "たくさんの物語をお届けしてきましたが、\nみなさん、楽しんでくれてますか～？", "zh": "我们为大家带来了许许多多的故事，大家都喜欢吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_12_1001_audience", "source_sha256": "e4c1f3bad61b7d4f4e1b97f0f625270bb2df9548604383db46f80b8114472513", "ja": "ワアアアアア！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_12_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "97f55dd83e9acd5c82ab26a2dd0cfbc80f2d8adb8d7daaf1d4bdbb1c766bfa49", "ja": "ご声援、ありがとうございます。本日の公演が、\n皆様の心に残る思い出となれば、私も嬉しいです。", "zh": "感谢大家的支持。如果今天的演出能成为各位心中难忘的回忆，我也会很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_12_1003_052kao", "source_sha256": "33d9cbdd54fddd4602582decc123f9d46897607739b65d4d096c7ffdc3183cd8", "ja": "本当に。つい時間を忘れてしまっていましたけれど……\nこの公演も、終わりが近づいてきてしまいました。", "zh": "真的。虽然不知不觉忘记了时间……但这场演出也快要结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_12_1004_audience", "source_sha256": "55f2acaed45b188b681bb9f1dd26b3ba32cebdc5b24f940e6d08236959f32fac", "ja": "えーーー！！", "zh": "啊————！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_12_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "7000c226edc57d9b94a5e0b32896edc40a12e8678ff10ab66778be1385280526", "ja": "始まりがあれば、終わりがあるというもの。\n皆様と同じく、私も後ろ髪をひかれる思いです。", "zh": "有始便有终。\n我也和诸位一样，感到依依不舍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_12_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "dc159b092e12d9dfe016f698b90f73c53059f8461eb84513511241d0a80458f1", "ja": "私もです。どんな物語も、エンディングが近づくと、\n寂しいな……って思っちゃいますもんね。", "zh": "我也是。无论怎样的故事，临近结局时，我都会忍不住觉得，有点寂寞呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_12_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "12553a6bf7463428c7c6d7d764cf2d55ba365ebba3807869168dd69c2467d632", "ja": "ですが……終わりは、新たな始まり。\n新たな出会いに向かって歩みを進めること。", "zh": "但是……结束，也是新的开始。\n朝着新的相遇迈步前行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_12_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "3df5c531ea488ae67ec40718ee396b43306fffc810df999542c9e18d4346bdf7", "ja": "本日の公演が終わりを迎えても、また次の公演で\n必ず、皆様とお会いできることでしょう。", "zh": "即使今天的公演落下帷幕，我们也一定能在下一场公演中与各位再次相见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_12_1009_audience", "source_sha256": "e4c1f3bad61b7d4f4e1b97f0f625270bb2df9548604383db46f80b8114472513", "ja": "ワアアアアア！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_12_1010_052kao", "source_sha256": "632c86afde1b41a2d274503f6269695b4ab7613f26663d578aee5f28fe31105d", "ja": "ふふっ、そうね。次も同じように……\nいいえ、もっと素敵なステージで歌えるように♪", "zh": "呵呵，说得对。为了下次也能像这样……\n不，要在更加精彩的舞台上歌唱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_12_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e5724d75e1a45ff7b0c1f5ef439c560f60b2982b4319fbdcb2fb605bf630d5ff", "ja": "そうですね。心残りなく、明日に向かうためにも。\n残りの時間を、精いっぱい楽しみましょう！", "zh": "是啊。为了毫无遗憾地迈向明天。\n让我们尽情享受剩下的时间吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_12_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "1972953d31aa74f557d7f01766c16e24b2f61e8e983d7b447b0c26d923100a90", "ja": "はい♪　今日の物語が終わったとしても……\n私たちの冒険は、まだこれからです！", "zh": "是的♪即使今天的故事落下帷幕……\n我们的冒险，也才刚刚开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_12_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "af37994ff216fb7c8657222ac8e595de8a2b4360b27ee8bb155fcfc40eca6c29", "ja": "私も、残っている力を振り絞って……。\n最高の時間をお届けできるよう、頑張ります！", "zh": "我也会竭尽所剩的力量……努力为大家带来最棒的时光！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_12_1014_audience", "source_sha256": "e4c1f3bad61b7d4f4e1b97f0f625270bb2df9548604383db46f80b8114472513", "ja": "ワアアアアア！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_12_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "70b6ab9db2d702e43aa03159a8c933ebcdefe3c1752902d6eefa8c98e9269b18", "ja": "それでは、らすとすぱーとと参りましょう。\n皆、準備はよろしいですか？", "zh": "那么，就让我们进行最后冲刺吧。\n大家都准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_12_1016_052kao", "source_sha256": "79847c85b5b556bcd3244803d26495e6d6b4110309e346de1697ba36813004dd", "ja": "もちろんよ、貴音ちゃん♪\n皆さん、最後まで一緒に、楽しみましょうね！", "zh": "当然没问题，贵音♪\n各位，一起享受这最后的时刻吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0142_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_12_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f3c8e65152e317733df5dc6dfd3dedf3279d488c2572950faccf2c1176426326", "ja": "私たち全員の感謝を……\n歌やダンスに乗せて、お伝えいたします！", "zh": "我们全体成员的感谢之情……\n将随着歌声与舞蹈，传达给大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
